# Batched validation

Progress tracker: `docs/validation/batch_index.json` — update after each batch.

## Run one batch (~7–10 min)

```powershell
docker compose exec worker python -m ml.evaluation.benchmark `
  --manifest /app/data/processed/uwf_iqa/manifest.json `
  --output /app/docs/validation/optos_benchmark_batchNN.json `
  --max-seg 0 --max-grading 10 --grading-offset OFFSET
```

- `OFFSET = (batch_number - 1) * 10`
- Grading only (no `--uwf-cohorts`) keeps each batch at exactly 10 images
- Reports persist via `./docs:/app/docs` mount

## After each batch

1. Commit `docs/validation/optos_benchmark_batchNN.json` if user asked to commit
2. Bump `batch_index.json`: `completed`, `next_batch`, `next_offset`

## Do not

- Re-run full `finalize-optos.ps1` for a single batch
- Paste TIFF warning spam into chat — summarize from batch JSON only
